  "definition": "Tuberculosis Patient Care Financial Assistance Program",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-07-24",
  "historyNote": "#6634, eff 11-25-97; ss by #8242, eff 12-30-04; ss by #9172, eff 6-6-08; ss by #12033, eff 11-3-16; amd by #12586, eff 7-24-18",
